# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha ee1cf6e6c74f1e9b; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-K8S-17
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: ee1cf6e6c74f1e9b
doc: Settings, Clusters, Platform services names Gitea (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Clusters, P: the Platform services panel offers Gitea as a service to deploy
not-covered: the rootless Deployment with SQLite on a PVC and the HTTP and SSH Services
not-covered: a deploy into a real cluster
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Clusters
click-sidebar Clusters
wait app=Settings page="Clusters"
shot page
expect-not-blank
key P
wait app=Settings text="Platform services"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Gitea
expect-page Clusters
